OL,3,GNEWSABayeux Tapestry embroidery found
OL,4,Ain school attic
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hand-stitched embroidery inspired by
OL,7,Fthe Bayeux Tapestry has been discovered
OL,8,Fhidden in the attic of a village
OL,9,Fschool.
OL,11,FThe 23ft-long (7m) artwork was found
OL,12,Fcovered in cobwebs at Uffington Church
OL,13,Fof England Primary School in
OL,14,FLincolnshire.
OL,16,FThought to date from the 1960s or
OL,17,F1970s, nobody at the school knows
OL,18,Fexactly when it was made or who spent
OL,19,Fhours stitching its historical scenes.
